  "description": "Tatakao is a bold handcrafted brush font inspired by the artistic spirit of Japanese calligraphy and modern street culture. Every letter is carefully drawn to deliver an energetic, expressive, and authentic brush appearance while remaining highly readable.\nIts natural brush texture and smooth flow make it ideal for creating eye-catching headlines, logos, branding, packaging, posters, restaurant menus, apparel, merchandise, social media graphics, YouTube thumbnails, book covers, album artwork, and advertising campaigns.\nThe font includes uppercase, lowercase, numbers, punctuation, multilingual support, and stylish ligatures that create a more natural handwritten feel.\nWhether you’re designing for Japanese-themed branding, Asian food packaging, travel posters, streetwear, or modern creative projects, Tatakao delivers bold personality with handcrafted authenticity.\nFeatures\n• Uppercase & Lowercase\n• Numbers & Punctuation\n• Multilingual Support\n• Standard Ligatures\n• OTF, TTF & WOFF\n• Works on Windows & Mac\nPerfect For\nJapanese Restaurant\nSushi Branding\nRamen Shop\nMatcha Packaging\nStreet Food\nAsian Market\nLogo Design\nBranding\nPackaging\nPoster Design\nMovie Title\nYouTube Thumbnail\nBook Cover\nApparel\nT-shirt Design\nSticker Design\nMerchandise\nSocial Media\nAdvertising\nProduct Label\nCafe Branding\nCraft Projects",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Tatakao is a bold handcrafted brush font inspired by the artistic spirit of Japanese calligraphy and modern street culture. Every letter is carefully drawn to deliver an energetic, expressive, and authentic brush appearance while remaining highly readable.</p>\n<p>Its natural brush texture and smooth flow make it ideal for creating eye-catching headlines, logos, branding, packaging, posters, restaurant menus, apparel, merchandise, social media graphics, YouTube thumbnails, book covers, album artwork, and advertising campaigns.</p>\n<p>The font includes uppercase, lowercase, numbers, punctuation, multilingual support, and stylish ligatures that create a more natural handwritten feel.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing for Japanese-themed branding, Asian food packaging, travel posters, streetwear, or modern creative projects, Tatakao delivers bold personality with handcrafted authenticity.</p>\n<p>Features<br>\n• Uppercase &amp; Lowercase<br>\n• Numbers &amp; Punctuation<br>\n• Multilingual Support<br>\n• Standard Ligatures<br>\n• OTF, TTF &amp; WOFF<br>\n• Works on Windows &amp; Mac</p>\n<p>Perfect For<br>\nJapanese Restaurant<br>\nSushi Branding<br>\nRamen Shop<br>\nMatcha Packaging<br>\nStreet Food<br>\nAsian Market<br>\nLogo Design<br>\nBranding<br>\nPackaging<br>\nPoster Design<br>\nMovie Title<br>\nYouTube Thumbnail<br>\nBook Cover<br>\nApparel<br>\nT-shirt Design<br>\nSticker Design<br>\nMerchandise<br>\nSocial Media<br>\nAdvertising<br>\nProduct Label<br>\nCafe Branding<br>\nCraft Projects</p>",
